section.p:
To do this, follow these steps:
Edit the oxygen.policy file and add lines such as the following:permission ro.sync.security.permission.FilePermission "path/to/yourSecretDir/-", "read,write,delete"; permission ro.sync.security.permission.FilePermission "path/to/yourSecretDir", "read,write,delete";
Use the following system property when starting the Tomcat server:-Dfile.protocol.blacklist=/path/to/yourSecretDirTo specify multiple directories, separate them using the value of the path.separator system property. For example, on Linux, the value of the path.separator property is the colon character (:).
